  coercive : ∀ x v, lower * dotProduct v v ≤ dotProduct v (g x *ᵥ v)
  upper : ℝ
  upper_pos : 0 < upper
  boundedAbove : ∀ x v, dotProduct v (g x *ᵥ v) ≤ upper * dotProduct v v
```

